  "description": "1990s Hong Kong.\n\nTaeseong, the perpetual second-in-command of the Heukcheong Gang, attempts a rebellion by taking advantage of the boss's absence—only to fail miserably.\n\nAs Taeseong begs for his life, the boss offers him a single way to survive...\n\n*“Betraying me, killing the executives, and even running off with company funds... If you win, I'll turn a blind eye to all of it.”*\n\n*“That is, if you don't ejaculate under my touch.”*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/hoyuhwan)",
